    "body": "Add H200 TP8 DSv4.1 Flash AgentX with embedded `MooncakeStoreConnector` DRAM KV offload, Engram UVA and golden synthetic AL 3.51. Concurrencies: **1, 2, 4, 8, 16, 32, 64, 128, 256, 512**. Uses full `semianalysis_cc_traces_weka_062126` traces. Host allocation reserves Engram and transfer buffers; eval keeps real verification. Follows the [upstream Mooncake recipe](https://github.com/vllm-project/recipes/blob/main/kv_store/kv_store_distributed_mooncake.yaml). Backports vLLM #54853 to fix Mooncake save crashes; enables VIRTIOFS prefetch, async prefix lookup and shared long-prefill steps without reducing warmup or raising the timeout. Local matrix, launcher, serving-command and Mooncake setup tests pass; GPU validation pending.\n\n\u65b0\u589e H200 TP8 DSv4.1 Flash AgentX\uff0c\u542f\u7528\u5d4c\u5165\u5f0f `MooncakeStoreConnector` DRAM KV \u5378\u8f7d\u3001Engram UVA \u548c\u9ec4\u91d1\u5408\u6210 AL 3.51\u3002\u5e76\u53d1\uff1a**1, 2, 4, 8, 16, 32, 64, 128, 256, 512**\u3002\u4f7f\u7528\u5b8c\u6574 `semianalysis_cc_traces_weka_062126` \u8f68\u8ff9\uff1b\u4e3b\u673a\u5185\u5b58\u5206\u914d\u9884\u7559 Engram \u548c\u4f20\u8f93\u7f13\u51b2\u533a\uff0ceval \u4fdd\u7559\u771f\u5b9e\u9a8c\u8bc1\u3002\u9075\u5faa\u4e0a\u8ff0\u4e0a\u6e38 Mooncake \u914d\u65b9\u3002\u56de\u79fb vLLM #54853 \u4fee\u590d Mooncake \u4fdd\u5b58\u5d29\u6e83\uff0c\u542f\u7528 VIRTIOFS \u9884\u53d6\u3001\u5f02\u6b65 prefix \u67e5\u8be2\u548c\u957f prefill \u5171\u4eab\u8c03\u5ea6\uff1b\u4e0d\u51cf\u5c11 warmup \u6216\u5ef6\u957f\u65f6\u9650\u3002\u672c\u5730\u77e9\u9635\u3001launcher\u3001\u670d\u52a1\u547d\u4ee4\u548c Mooncake \u542f\u52a8\u6d4b\u8bd5\u901a\u8fc7\uff0cGPU \u9a8c\u8bc1\u5f85\u5b8c\u6210\u3002\n\n<!-- CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> **Medium Risk**\n> New agentic sweep path mutates in-container vLLM sources, sizes host DRAM/KV aggressively at high concurrency, and remains GPU-validation pending despite extensive local harness tests.\n> \n> **Overview**\n> Adds **`dsv41flash-fp4-h200-vllm-agentic-dspark-mooncake`**: H200 TP8 AgentX for DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash with embedded **Mooncake** DRAM KV offload, Engram UVA CPU offload, five-token **DSpark** (golden synthetic AL 3.51 for throughput), 1M context, and concurrency **1\u2013512** on full `semianalysis_cc_traces_weka_062126`.\n> \n> **Shared benchmark plumbing:** `select_available_server_port()` for host-network collisions; `setup_agentic_mooncake()` (byte-accurate host budget, Mooncake 0.3.11.post1, master startup). The vLLM agentic script applies a **Python backport of vLLM #54853** (no `git` in the preview image), caps CUDA graph capture at **512** when Mooncake is on, and adds prefetch, long-prefill sharing, and async prefix lookup.\n> \n> **Routing and docs:** H200 launcher mounts **`/ix`** for `dsv41flash` so AgentX runtime dirs avoid `/workspace`; **MODELS** matrix row and **perf-changelog** entries document the key. Tests cover Mooncake setup, port selection, launcher mounts, trace corpus choice, and patch idempotency.\n> \n> <sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit e86339c847aebcd91bc8345c44e390c677b575ea. Bugbot is set up for automated code reviews on this repo. Configure [here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\n<!-- /CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\n\n",
